  "id": "3e75d9c1-5659-5393-8769-6c4395b344ad",
  "slug": "caramelized-onion-and-roasted-garlic-pasta-recipe-8724725",
  "name": "Caramelized Onion and Roasted Garlic Pasta",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "Caramelized onion and roasted garlic pasta is a great comfort food dish. Short pasta in a creamy roasted garlic and caramelized onion sauce hits all the cozy notes of fall.",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "To roast garlic: Preheat the oven to 250 degrees F (120 degrees C). Place the garlic cloves in a shallow baking dish and cover with olive oil. Lay the sprigs of thyme on top of the oil."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 1 hour. Garlic should easily mash with a fork. Remove garlic from oil and set aside. Reserve oil for another use."
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "text": "To caramelize onions: Heat a roomy skillet over medium heat. Add butter and olive oil. Add onions to the pan and stir to coat. Stir frequently and move onions around, ensuring they cook evenly."
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "text": "Once onions have started to color a bit (about 15 minutes or so), add in water, vinegar, sugar, salt, and pepper. Continue to stir regularly until onions are completely soft, a golden brown color, and reduced by at least half, about 15 minutes more. Turn down the heat to medium low."
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add gemelli and cook, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 11 minutes.. Meanwhile, add cream, 4 to 5 cloves roasted garlic, 1 tablespoon parsley, and 1/2 cup Parmesan cheese to onions; stir to combine. Reserve remaining roasted garlic for another use."
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "text": "Drain pasta; divide among 4 plates. Spoon about a 1/4 cup of sauce on top; sprinkle with more Parmesan cheese, parsley, and black pepper."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 4,
  "cooking_time_minutes": 105,
  "preparation_time_minutes": 30,
  "rest_time_minutes": null,
